WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.502
-The rules of the game
are very simple.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.569
I will give each of you

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:04.603
a password.
-Password.

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:07.140
-Then you are to give
a one-word clue.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.741
That's one word only.
-How many?

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:09.976
-One.
-Okay.

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:12.444
-To get your password
to guess the password.

00:00:12.444 --> 00:00:15.648
The team with the most points
after four words wins.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:16.850
-Okay.
-Any questions?

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.251
-Well --
-Great. Let's move on.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.853
